! mcp_bootstrap_p355.strap -- MCP printed page 355: the $DUMP program's
! floating-point / index-field edit: AFMPY (sign and exponent-flag
! characters into the print image via $R, branching to AFLPT1/AFLPT2),
! AIMNDX (an AL40 multiply indexing AIMNTB), ABRCH/ABRIND/ABINDF/ABND1
! (branch and index flags from $13, AINDCR, back to ARETRN), and
! ADIRX/ADIRX2 (direction field through ADRNDX and AHXTB), lines 1-50.
!
! docs/MCP_Mar63_250-445.pdf PDF p.105, read at 400 dpi (crops upscaled
! 2x-4x for names).  Header, READ: "TIME CLOCK 00054041  PUNID 22$DUMP
! CARD ID VB000598  DIST. OF 3/01  3/01  PAGE NUMBER 355"; the heading
! row's LOCATION field is 235622, line 1's word.
!
! STILL THE $DUMP (PUNID 22$DUMP, VB... series).  No new SLC, no TAIL.
!
! THE PAGE.  50 lines; every line number prints a "*".  "*" after the
! LOCATION on lines 6, 20, 34, 47.  Remarks on lines 32 (-B) and 41
! (-Z).  Located rows contiguous from 235622.40 (line 1) to 235674.40
! (line 50, LF, a full word; next 235675.40), then blank paper.
!
! JOIN.  p.354 (tools/page_sheet.py 354) ends with B,AFLPT1+1. at
! 235622.00, a half word: next 235622.40 = line 1.  p.356 opens at
! 235675.40: contiguous both ways.
!
! GLYPHS SETTLED BY OTHER THAN PLAIN INK:
!   * "ACIRX2" (lines 20, 29 B targets; line 47's label also prints the
!     second glyph stemless): line 44's ADIRX prints a clear D, and the
!     B rows assemble 235672.10 = line 47's own location, so the
!     symbol is the ADIRX family: written ADIRX2.
!   * AFLPT1 (line 3): last glyph has the top-left flag of a 1 and no
!     I serif (compared with LFI's I on line 2, 4x crop); family with
!     AFLPT2.
!   * ABND1 (lines 36, 43): last glyph flagged, a 1.  AHXTB (line 50):
!     flat-backed B, not 8.
!   * octal / hex fields with an open round read 0 ("FO" = F0, "CO" =
!     00, ".CC" = .00).
!
! EXTERNALS.  None is defined by a landed deck; values from this page's
! binary.  VFL addresses are BIT-EXACT; B targets (less B's .10) and
! LVI addresses (less the J field) give the half word only.
!
! CARD SERIALS.  VB000598 .. VB000647, one per line, none shared or
! skipped.

AFLPT1  SYN, (8)235574.0             ! not landed; B line 3 235574.10, half word only
AFLPT2  SYN, (8)235577.0             ! not landed; B line 7 235577.10 (line 11 AFLPT2-1. 235576.10), half word only
AL40    SYN, (8)236174.06            ! not landed; * line 16 236174.06, BIT-EXACT
AIMNTB  SYN, (8)236406.0             ! not landed; L line 18 236406.00, BIT-EXACT
ANXBR   SYN, (8)236264.0             ! not landed; LVI line 22 236264.03, half word only
AINDCR  SYN, (8)236276.0             ! not landed; LF line 33 236276.00, BIT-EXACT
ARETRN  SYN, (8)235377.0             ! not landed; B line 39 235377.10, half word only
ADRNDX  SYN, (8)236254.0             ! not landed; L line 46 236254.00, BIT-EXACT
AHXTB   SYN, (8)236232.10            ! not landed; LF line 50 236232.10, BIT-EXACT

        SLC, (8)235622.40
